{"voice":"am_michael","fps":60,"clips":{"Ah! There you are. Come in, come in. Mind the legs, they have a mind of their own.":{"file":"f3e9fe1635.mp3","who":"wn","duration":5.228,"env":""},"The city is running on fumes. Children these days just do not scream like they used to.":{"file":"19c73cd799.mp3","who":"wn","duration":6.133,"env":""},"I need a good scream out of you. Use that microphone of yours, or hold the space bar if you are shy.":{"file":"4e42feccd6.mp3","who":"wn","duration":7.369,"env":""},"Rolling blackouts again. Do you know what that does to a CEO's blood pressure?":{"file":"adcb7f4da9.mp3","who":"wn","duration":5.075,"env":""},"Three generations of Waternooses built this company. I will not be the one who turns off the lights.":{"file":"9528ac0f91.mp3","who":"wn","duration":6.9,"env":""},"Look out there. Half of Monstropolis is sitting in the dark.":{"file":"6fbfb393ce.mp3","who":"wn","duration":3.925,"env":""},"The board meets in the morning. They will want numbers. I would very much like to give them some.":{"file":"d72b55104f.mp3","who":"wn","duration":6.075,"env":""},"Now THAT is the spirit! My grandfather would have hired you on the spot.":{"file":"ffb144017c.mp3","who":"wn","duration":4.531,"env":""},"Hear that hum? That is the sound of lights coming back on all over the city.":{"file":"408ebcde20.mp3","who":"wn","duration":4.951,"env":""},"Keep it coming. Every canister is a neighbourhood with the heating on.":{"file":"d9ff7c050c.mp3","who":"wn","duration":4.473,"env":""},"Oh, that is the good stuff!":{"file":"7fb714ae02.mp3","who":"wn","duration":1.732,"env":"A3ixwub/////////+uLNvaKbkomBa1hOSVCu3tDV19XQ2aaIrL/DurOfno50VEQ/YJGmf2heWlFGVoDD3tXExa59WipFcqq8qaBWFAQqo9rhy7+jakM2LCQYERQaHSAfHRkSDQgFAwI="},"Magnificent! Simply magnificent!":{"file":"b4b6e882db.mp3","who":"wn","duration":2.592,"env":"BDFedL3u7/n/4sKWcW90iaK3yeX/////rj84PTVi0duZgHVwZWViPX6Xl4t1VjY1LBUTCAUHBgQFBgYGBQUFBAMDBxMoR2V0eHSe///53c+kXjQaLz9YeaOljoWFhpealY2RsLSkq7WzvaaRb2Vtd42qrbq7tcfFcEM0MSldkZqGYWJgX1leOlRoYFA8NBggGQwOBgYWCwYDAwIB"},"Yes! YES! Fill those canisters!":{"file":"3e20a1ddd9.mp3","who":"wn","duration":2.207,"env":"BCJYaoep4f//////9eTNsJBcRFJTTUE4KRwWCAcpQ1hmbnml7f/////92syrkF9AUlVURSgkHxscIYbMup6VjYVgUVtgi6ikkpSWiIl5ZmBVJhEINkY8Moqvs6mjoaOoobO5wqyBWmdoURQEBCdKWVZGPS0tIiQcGxkTHyQjHA8IBAMCAQ=="},"Quota met! I have not felt this good since the great brownout of seventy three!":{"file":"1810542fab.mp3","who":"wn","duration":5.106,"env":""},"The whole city is lit up. Take a look. You did that.":{"file":"b145e0de22.mp3","who":"wn","duration":3.277,"env":"BCBokqSRa1hRaZXJ///y2NDQwcOoeIGmppWVgYKHVJK+sLCTU2R6gnBvc26Eg4iPl5WAem9mUkpXcnh8f42ztbi4q51tncnJ087awad9Vj8wGAsGBAUXGBAOCggHCAoIBgQ2ZVWV3NXIomc+HDc5gbCtgn16cHSBl/D/////5q1rLA4HAwQXIxYOCwgGBQUEBAQDAwQEIldneJegpZFwZ1lOUHXG7+7t985vZlVQR0RFb52Wi4l4Y1hINTIxGB0VDw8FBAI="},"Please. I am a chief executive, not some petting zoo.":{"file":"1c8d3055a2.mp3","who":"wn","duration":3.882,"env":""},"That was one of my eyes. Well. One of the five.":{"file":"63c36ffd96.mp3","who":"wn","duration":3.345,"env":"BCyc1cjJu7SaZExReZGEo6RzTE1jkLmwopmfqbWeZFlSXX+SoJeBhoOQlo6RfW5WPEtXbHyLl6GforKvqpWDdF5LPzEmJBcfKBwWOVp7f3xjLQ8FBgUGBgUFBAQDAwQEBAMDBCBRWXnO//f1/////+3ev7+noId3YkcxHQkFBAQEBAMDAwQEE1Bxjpqisa20ubmJbF5QRUpglZFbPT8/OTgwKyau4a6JhHyNp6asl35tVUIvLSEfGhoRGhoPDwwTFxcUDggEAgIB"},"Careful with the suit. It is tailored for six legs and that is NOT cheap.":{"file":"cc3bb8df11.mp3","who":"wn","duration":4.86,"env":""},"Do you poke all your employers like this?":{"file":"9271adde04.mp3","who":"wn","duration":2.604,"env":"AyIzVXyCkJKQoJ2CUS4ZCGlyRXm06v/////ndzwbCT9LKhAJBAMDB9fpy8/h7v3/++/j2tDEu5uAdGBbbI2VjJGUjJySlZusramNXTMQQ00pIRsVaJquoZqovtLRxq2rr6ack5GRjYuLg25vb0gpW4GPjoiGgXpcKxANDQYHDiNgl5uPY0syKyAaFRo5SWBteG1hWkgvFwgEAwICAA=="},"Oho! Easy now. That is a lifetime of company lunches.":{"file":"dd9666b05e.mp3","who":"wn","duration":4.219,"env":""},"Watch the vest. It is older than you are.":{"file":"9a05a3b32a.mp3","who":"wn","duration":2.895,"env":"BTJdb6nh/f/////zvVUZOXnBwZhUHQwTU7G+e2lcXlpbat7//////8urmnlVMS5PaHZ7gnpVGgQTHBoOBQUFBQYHBgUFBQUFBQUFBQMDWaHO0q234vDMopmZf5NRIgoEEfD0+Pf/9+3v1MzNxLiJX0xjhKiro6uehWZcXXWdqaivqKqusLawqKGSk46KkpOJgpOalpmSmZmOkY5/eF9PRzk8JSIkHB4hFRAKBgQB"},"Sometimes a company must make difficult decisions.":{"file":"35858d56c5.mp3","who":"wn","duration":3.351,"env":"BA0gNlNqZ73////UorSpo4hYMzFHYrK4ucDBv8O2sbGlmpSNg25FPElFTFAbCgkEMWN5b0ceCARHcVZTg7jm6ryqpXdAGwgfWaWziYKVpqSdmZuXm5uWj5mVnqqboLConXaBgWE9GggNW4SMnYuSjImHdVk9KRsWHigtMC1In+r/83U+NTAtbnFSNR4xPliEi39+UygVFBgdNVZ7gWRdaGNdWFhQNYe9v72oiXJhX2RLSUs7MCYXFxoMDAoJCQoPGSAbEwoDAgIBAA=="},"I will keep the lights on in this city. Whatever. It. Takes.":{"file":"d3ca611771.mp3","who":"wn","duration":4.076,"env":""},"Do not worry. Nobody will ever know about the machine in the basement.":{"file":"6ea0bcd47f.mp3","who":"wn","duration":4.76,"env":""},"Profits are down, you see, and I am running out of patience.":{"file":"327b9da00f.mp3","who":"wn","duration":3.979,"env":""},"Ahem. Where was I? Ah yes. Quarterly targets. Wonderful things.":{"file":"2e90695ec1.mp3","who":"wn","duration":4.553,"env":""},"My father taught me this one. Six legs, and every one of them a left foot!":{"file":"4025d1c2ac.mp3","who":"wn","duration":4.824,"env":""},"Not bad for a monster my age, eh?":{"file":"6bbf642bfe.mp3","who":"wn","duration":2.272,"env":"BkKAtd3////3wXVfTE9INOz////u9//u9Pzy//+8Z05MVVdXRzWswLuiyMTNw7K/08u3vs7d39bArHNpv9+sRwskOZHJtZSmrsO4yrunqaq1tbmhoYh0gIWirbm3uqyspKOelYt4X0QuTZuzlGFUHw0JBQSRs6ax2dnFpnZLNC4iEhgSExIJBgE="},"Walk with me.":{"file":"403b870abe.mp3","who":"wn","duration":1.067,"env":"Ax1GUV1rkrjQ//////zz0qJrKBMGBCA0GTpzm8HLxY1PQj85KjBmf5GZnZqLgnxsWkw1NCoeLiwlIhEJBwUDAgA="},"Ah, the view. Every one of those windows runs on a scream, you know.":{"file":"814cb0d32d.mp3","who":"wn","duration":4.514,"env":""},"I do my best thinking on my feet. All six of them.":{"file":"9451564c27.mp3","who":"wn","duration":3.613,"env":"CClVquPD3d+0l3V2sOz2166/yb7a1rmuqKuwroJ2Y1xMXNnm4OHc0bKGb4N4WjwoHRYTEhMQK4LCqZ2bmYRaOTsoUYaKf4+PlqKaoJmakZyMlJGjmo6Zo62ti00tLCwnJSQhHh1/p6CMi314emtVRDArIRIKCiEUCgYEBAQFBgYGBQYGBgUFBQYGBwcFBAMCAgnd9/////////PguoRxi6Kdlod7cW9qU7/x3rx9Ng8IO0Rdc3p1ZmmbqJuOaFVKSUlKQ0dWfHxpTzk6JyYiJx8PHBYKBgQDAg=="},"Hmm. Quiet night.":{"file":"eb84bb05af.mp3","who":"wn","duration":1.292,"env":"DRknO0+f9v///////+7QyruxpqKHaUEgPVZENiOJ//////Pr4dnV2tHU1cCBNzBHYXmMuNHNwK6fj4FoXVI2QjEjHgwcJygaDwgFAwMB"},"Still there? The canisters will not fill themselves, you know.":{"file":"1ed20bbb07.mp3","who":"wn","duration":3.602,"env":"CBg2XHp0IAYCGEKn///////y18iOUUhJUpL36cm7tbqok4V0bUwpJx0TDQkFBAQEAwMDAyc7k4hUIwsESVFIQUSKv8/Twb7CvrW1xcjAm3uRspxiJQYJGihoiXx0fm9mYmtVMTU8WXp8jX+EjoaTk6KYn62tpKuKWiwZFBskJigpJSIjntjT4MavrKl8Q0lKXYOampeRkIyMgGJGTF5oXlE0aZiNiXp4aWZbUkc8Ozg0LigmLDxAKxsvTGdyhJKPlJaQjI6PhHxxY01JOzAhHBUVGg8QBwUDAA=="},"You know, I have been at this desk for forty years. It still feels like yesterday.":{"file":"4f618111b9.mp3","who":"wn","duration":5.262,"env":""},"And THAT is how it was done in my day.":{"file":"3c122b95bb.mp3","who":"wn","duration":2.303,"env":"A4mxv9Hl69qygW3c///s5vHz3cvCt4EzNX+xtqaClc3Ytls8RUVMSlqBk6OmqbPF4t3Dzr+ol29bHzA/U3qHhI6LiGA6Nzo5MVWT///y1tvb29K/t7q7pKCLjIyUp7Wvr6KhnKWumImBmKCrpbOurI54Xko6TorA2tDNs4xnU0UyLhYYFwsQEQwIAQ=="},"Still got it. Three generations of scarers, you know.":{"file":"3eac0e365d.mp3","who":"wn","duration":3.593,"env":"BRIrSGlNFQQbO8L////cvbSLWk9RTUlBcrHx5/L+//v////////n0KVdZH13YEY5GxkRBgUEBAQFBQUGBwcHCAkICAcGBQUGDBIgJztJP2p6stPIvLWwnodvWU5blZTI///DtZiZm6WjnoeKlq6nmaCvtKqik3pnmaWMi4RSf5qfmKWejm1cY4qKaFZJZYJ+ioSHaycJBxszgcXDqKCrpaudmJyUk4yIhXZvbWZhX1tWUkRHPykhLVp6jKGlnp2cnJOalIuEdV9ZRkAqJyMWIBoWFAoHBAMC"},"Pardon me. I get carried away.":{"file":"67d4bae03d.mp3","who":"wn","duration":2.177,"env":"Aj5dhnxqgcv8//////////CTcWJ1mre3wMe/sLi0rJ2SkJyEgn5mShgHBwoKCQkJCQkKDQ4IB3Gn1N/lwJRuY23G///abz8UCAM/YmxdQ5C3sZmVkZWWjJmMmKuVfJK5u7yskH1zgqLJwby6z+vi4riZcFhCOigqHRceFxkUDwsHBAE="},"No microphone? Never mind. Hold the space bar and scream on my behalf.":{"file":"a27271e565.mp3","who":"wn","duration":5.785,"env":""},"Now THAT is a scream, my friend! Put that one in the company newsletter.":{"file":"724d8aa0da.mp3","who":"wn","duration":4.75,"env":""},"Extraordinary! I have not heard a scream like that in thirty years.":{"file":"23bb466570.mp3","who":"wn","duration":4.484,"env":""},"Excellent! Real terror in that one. Wonderful form.":{"file":"96ec33f0c4.mp3","who":"wn","duration":3.704,"env":""},"Very good. The board would be most impressed.":{"file":"c57b9661ad.mp3","who":"wn","duration":3.09,"env":"Bi05Q1yA0vzhzcTEv7qwrrCvqJmIa1NQS1FMQldYnd7///////LVtpVePzouJSESGBUMBgUEBgYGBgcGBgYFBQUFBAMDClOtv5ydhnNiUkdanuv////56PT/////8NjUxXtbV1xufZGIXFpHQ01+k4uXl5ymnpikoJuVkZmZlJiDiLrAmUkPHTFag5WSmpeRflwvED4/KislLK7X0cbPtXpUPjYoIBonSmR2fo2FXyQGExgXCwQDAgIB"},"Respectable. I have heard worse from professionals.":{"file":"936444fc97.mp3","who":"wn","duration":3.21,"env":"BjJbkbLRzLDCwKyWWCYHBge6////69OMLRAKBgMEQ7jlmYJvbHugsJyCYV1AOi4mEwkFBQYGBgcIBwcHCAgICQkKCggENYm97+Hq/vHk4dCAZ2BUUExLaI/C9Pf//////79nb4SAbnJwbYGr2fDs5+zp5tbEuKWRn6SMZjgyKSB6oaWhoolvRkJGcZaMeVk4LismMbXKurCppJZ8jKSMeW1EZISMiIN5cmNKODAsISQfHhoXIy89QkY1HA4GBQMDAQ=="},"Not bad at all. A little more lungs next time.":{"file":"8d1fd47435.mp3","who":"wn","duration":3.134,"env":"BUV9m8zv//r///3XflAwNCtARkhBz//b0r7FwsPG0c/LyMqqfrbFw8G+noGuwsi8xODa7+TTu5B6ZElDNRwpGw0GBAUFBgcHCAcHBwgICQkIDQoJBxmtyLK8ppvy//+47P/WkLXDvrCwxb2joqWntYxwb3Z/goWexO//7Obr5NPCtK/AvMzIqpCetpo0G3e31c/BwLmWSRIpRJPQv55MECVMhkxnn6mmnaijl4+BZEQ8MycpGRsYFRYNCQcA"},"Hmm. A little thin. Put your back into it.":{"file":"f33d2d2d9c.mp3","who":"wn","duration":2.59,"env":"CRUiNEV23v//////////7tjHy8OyoI1lXkpLdJismpuRho/O5+2ucbHHtbungFtSVFJRRkM8MzTA///t4Obu4eHOqoZlVVNBKC8rLCERDAgKCAgHBwYEBwcFBAQHTkLR/7BnWWZ9ocfQrYN4bGv0//vx6uLY2sClXRsJMzlkqbi9tq6HWkqJtoE8ZYV9bmVoYVc4OR0eFgsIBQUB"},"That might power a desk